#### [NEW] [services/anomaly_detector/main.py](file:///c:/Users/krish/OneDrive/Desktop/MyProject/services/anomaly_detector/main.py)
- FastAPI app with `/health` and `GET /alerts` endpoints.
- Background task on startup that:
  1. Connects to Kafka topic `app-logs` with consumer group `anomaly-detector`.
  2. Maintains a deque of `(timestamp, is_error)` tuples representing the sliding window.
  3. Every 10s evaluates the window — if error count > threshold, inserts a row into `anomaly_alerts` and logs a structured warning.
- On startup, connects to Postgres and creates the `anomaly_alerts` table.

